{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415040","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041504001:1":{"text":"여기 있는 사람들은 악의가 없습니다. 걱정하지 않으셔도 돼요.","source_cn":"这里的人没有恶意,您不必担心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D11FA55ED05511F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041504002:1":{"text":"걱정? 난 그딴 건 하지 않아.","source_cn":"担心?我从没有这种东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FC12DC4CA24C0DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041504003:1":{"text":"무슨 일이 일어나도 나는 싸울 수 있다!","source_cn":"无论发生什么,我都能一战!","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B75CBAEDEDFD7DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041504004:1":{"text":"때로는 싸움이 유일한 해결책이 아닐 수도 있어요.","source_cn":"有的时候,战斗不是唯一的解决方式。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EB85C3C775C787A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041504005:1":{"text":"싸움으로 해결할 수 없는 게 뭐가 있지?","source_cn":"没有什么不能通过战斗解决。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5588AE721546E8B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041504006:1":{"text":"보니, 너에게 무기를 내려놓게 하는 자들을 경계하거라.","source_cn":"波妮,你该警惕让你放下武器的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x510CBC58379BF091","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041504007:1":{"text":"그들은 너의 나약함에 대한 대가를 요구할 것이니, 희생양이 되지 말길.","source_cn":"他们在让你支付软弱的代价,别像待宰的羔羊一样,别遂了他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68F0DECF19E20563","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041504008:1":{"text":"하지만...","source_cn":"可是......","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x743C3A08990E68BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041504009:1":{"text":"이제는 내 말을 의심하기 시작한 모양이군?","source_cn":"你已经开始怀疑我说的是不是对的了?","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D15A91AFB81BFA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041504010:1":{"text":"그들이 네 마음에 의심을 심어놨다니, 정말 기가 막힐 노릇이군.","source_cn":"他们竟然还在你心里种下了怀疑,真该死啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFDF53D3CA41E6A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041504011:1":{"text":"적어도 가족 같은 당신 앞에서는 항상 경계할 필요가 없다고 생각했을 뿐이에요.","source_cn":"我只是觉得,至少面对像家人一样的您,我不必时刻保持警惕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CAADBF4E44C04BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041504012:1":{"text":"가족? 어리석고 순진하긴.","source_cn":"家人?瞧瞧你,多么愚蠢的天真啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AF936142E3D830F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041504013:1":{"text":"아니요... 언젠가는 제가 옳다는 것을 알게 될 거예요.","source_cn":"不.....迟早有一天,您会发现我是对的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEDEE7BE01A3C1A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041504014:1":{"text":"언젠가는 너의 잘못된 믿음에 대해 큰 대가를 치르게 될 거다.","source_cn":"迟早有一天,你会为自己错误的认知支付高昂的代价。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C684C9B7335804C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:波妮":{"text":"보니","source":"波妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:霍德希金":{"text":"호드킨","source":"霍德希金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":2}}